{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264hzZ3UPXNn1795786976.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>八達通卡公司今早偵測到系統受到網絡攻擊，涉及約7,500名客戶個人資料，包括姓名及相片，亦可能涉及自動增值服務資料，包括銀行編號及自動增值金額，但不涉信用卡或銀行戶口資料。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CARD-2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gS3nnLAMbe1795786984.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>此外，有約2.2萬名商戶一般資料同受影響，包括公司聯絡人姓名、職位、電郵地址及電話號碼。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:50:28.127817+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T03:37:27.701959+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T14:43:43.244323+00:00","content_hash":"e3863b1563c56e89273f72145aa07220644e03a27825ef59272986af6edc0323","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}